l\":37733376,\"iPod9,1\":36611072,\"iPhone14,8\":36240384,\"iPad13,16\":36195328,\"iPad6,7\":36615168,\"iPad6,4\":36615168,\"iPad6,3\":36615168,\"iPad6,8\":36615168,\"iPad13,8\":36615168,\"iPad13,9\":36615168,\"iPad13,4\":36615168,\"iPad13,5\":36615168,\"iPad13,6\":36615168,\"iPad13,7\":36615168,\"iPad13,1\":36615168,\"iPad13,2\":36615168}},\"relationships\":{\"app-events\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/app-events?l=en-US\",\"data\":[]},\"reviews\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/reviews?l=en-US\",\"next\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/reviews?l=en-US\u0026offset=10\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"9474887392\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-05T18:44:20Z\",\"review\":\"I absolutely love HabitKit. It is by far the best habit tracking app I have ever used. The tile-based grid charts make it super easy to visualize my progress, and the customization options for the dashboard are a great touch. The ability to choose my own colors, icons, and descriptions really helps me to personalize the app to my own needs and goals.\\n\\nOne of the things I love most about HabitKit is the motivation it provides. Seeing the tiles on my dashboard fill up with color as I complete my habits is a great way to stay motivated and on track. The app is also very user-friendly and easy to navigate. I highly recommend HabitKit to anyone looking to form new habits or break old ones.\\n\\nOverall, I would give HabitKit a solid 5 out of 5 stars. It has truly made a difference in my life and I am so grateful to have found it. Thank you, for creating such a wonderful app!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Chevy Phillip\",\"title\":\"The Ultimate Habit Tracking App!\"}},{\"id\":\"9475276997\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-05T21:22:57Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34150130,\"body\":\"Thank you so much for taking the time to review HabitKit and for sharing your experience! I appreciate your support and am grateful that you have chosen to use HabitKit. Thank you for your review, and I hope you continue to find success with the app.\",\"modified\":\"2023-01-08T08:18:03Z\"},\"review\":\"I absolutely love HabitKit! It is by far the best habit tracking app I have ever used. The tile-based grid charts make it super easy to visualize my progress, and the customization options for the dashboard are a great touch. The ability to choose my own colors, icons, and descriptions really helps me to personalize the app to my own needs and goals.\\n\\nOne of the things I love most about HabitKit is the motivation it provides. Seeing the tiles on my dashboard fill up with color as I complete my habits is a great way to stay motivated and on track. The app is also very user-friendly and easy to navigate. I highly recommend HabitKit to anyone looking to form new habits or break old ones.\\n\\nOverall, I would give HabitKit a solid 5 out of 5 stars. It has truly made a difference in my life and I am so grateful to have found it. Thank you, Sebastian, for creating such a wonderful app!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Chevy Phillip\",\"title\":\"The Ultimate Habit Tracking App!\"}},{\"id\":\"9508254597\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-15T01:07:29Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34301376,\"body\":\"Thank you for your review! I'm really glad to hear that HabitKit feels right for you and that you like the visual display of your streak. Thanks for using HabitKit!\",\"modified\":\"2023-01-16T07:07:46Z\"},\"review\":\"I’ve been using the “don’t break the chain” method of habit building for about a billion years. I’ve used apps and my own paper trackers. They all work, more or less, but some just feel better than others, and with something simple like habit tracking, feel is 90% of what’s important.\\n\\nHabitKit has FEEL son!\\n\\nThere’s something about the simplicity of the app and the ease of logging that just feels right. But more than that, the visual display of your streak is the best I’ve come across. It’s RIGHT in your face. There’s no ignoring it… and that’s a very very good thing.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"dörkåsbord\",\"title\":\"Fresh take on an old style of habit tracking\"}},{\"id\":\"9410648676\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2022-12-18T21:53:44Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":33834604,\"body\":\"Thank you for your positive review of HabitKit!  I'm glad that you find the app to be a good value at its current price point. I hope that HabitKit continues to be a helpful tool for you as you work towards your goals. Thank you for your support!\",\"modified\":\"2022-12-20T14:39:39Z\"},\"review\":\"HabitKit is an exciting app. It's gorgeous to see, it's a joy to use, it may well be best in class. Also: The developer is friendly and responsive to feature requests... HabitKit has arrived just in time for the new year; I expect to use the app each- and every day... I'm happy to see that it's buyable (subscription not required!) and right now, priced at just 15 bucks, it's well worth it too... Give this app a try -- it's great already and it'll get only better!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Great app, great price\",\"userName\":\"Wooooooooooooooo0\"}},{\"id\":\"9466333479\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-03T13:11:03Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34109438,\"body\":\"Thank you so much for your kind words. Lots of improvements and new features will come to HabitKit in the future!\",\"modified\":\"2023-01-05T11:57:29Z\"},\"review\":\"I’ve been looking for a solution to help keep track of my workouts, reading, and alcohol consumption. Specifically, I wanted a solution that would let me visualize my progress in those areas. HabitKit nails the visualization for me. \\n\\nThe maker of HabitKit is also quick to respond to questions and suggestions, which is a great sign of what’s to come with this solution.\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Simple and visually effective\",\"userName\":\"eric.peters\"}},{\"id\":\"9444885362\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2022-12-28T19:23:07Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34014486,\"body\":\"Thank you very much for your review and your feedback! I'll add this to the list of possible features for future updates!\",\"modified\":\"2022-12-30T15:48:05Z\"},\"review\":\"The app is beautifully made and approachable. My suggestions are reminders that keep bugging you until you complete something. Also it would be nice to have habits that can reoccur multiple times per day. For example 4 sets of 25 push-ups per day\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Well done\",\"userName\":\"thx you!\"}},{\"id\":\"9474660163\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-05T17:18:52Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34150143,\"body\":\"Thank you very much for your amazing review, Martin! \",\"modified\":\"2023-01-08T08:19:53Z\"},\"review\":\"This app is perfect. I really want to start reading, work out more regularly and drink water.. just being more healthy or conscious how I spend my day. And this really helps my forgetful mind to keep track of what I’ve done but also what I still need to do :D\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Martin Lasek\",\"title\":\"New Year New Me 2023!\"}},{\"id\":\"9411780396\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2022-12-19T06:43:11Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":33847913,\"body\":\"Thank you for your review! I'm glad you found the app to be simple and motivating. I promise to continuing to improve it.\",\"modified\":\"2022-12-21T05:44:27Z\"},\"review\":\"I search everywhere apps, most of them aren’t what I want because too advanced. This app is very simply and made me motivated want use this app everyday, this is exactly what I’m looking for. Keep it up!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Travgalax\",\"title\":\"Simply Habit app\"}},{\"id\":\"9336703919\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2022-11-28T02:43:59Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":33429788,\"body\":\"Thank you for this awesome review, Walid!\",\"modified\":\"2022-11-29T11:33:12Z\"},\"review\":\"I always wanted to see how my habits are formed like github activities and found no apps than habitKit. This is the best app for tracking any kind of habits. Very simple and clean! Thanks for creating such a great app\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"userName\":\"Al Walid Ashik\",\"title\":\"Best app for habit tracking\"}},{\"id\":\"9470888225\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-01-04T17:18:10Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":34117759,\"body\":\"Thank you very much for your review!\",\"modified\":\"2023-01-05T20:27:10Z\"},\"review\":\"Huge fan of the clean interface and functionality of this app!\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Love this app!!!\",\"userName\":\"Aj Picard 2525\"}}]},\"top-in-apps\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/apps/6443918070/top-in-apps?l=en-US\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"6444183590\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/6444183590?l=en-US\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=990\u0026salableAdamId=6444183590\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.99\",\"price\":0.99,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[],\"recurringSubscriptionPeriod\":\"P1M\"}],\"isSubscription\":true,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"offerName\":\"habitkit_0099_1m\",\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"isMerchandisedEnabled\":false,\"name\":\"HabitKit Pro (1 Month)\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Unlimited access to all features\"},\"subscriptionFamilyId\":\"21044815\",\"icuLocale\":\"en_US@currency=USD\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/habitkit-pro-1-month/id6443918070\"}},{\"id\":\"6444258879\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/us/in-apps/6444258879?l=en-US\",